+        # This mirrors the exact formula of _compute_flashinfer_kv_metadata,
+        # so the result equals what a fresh build() would compute for the
+        # advanced seq lens -- but entirely in persistent GPU buffers, which
+        # is what the captured CUDA graph requires (no host copies, no
+        # device-to-device index copy, no Python recompute at replay).
